// Canonical article content. Static REL; no Markdown or embedded markup.
("grow.room", "isa", "ReadingArticle")
("grow.room", "title", "Room to Grow")
("grow.room", "deck", "Jesus grew. You have room to grow too.")
("grow.room", "route", "worlds/dad/threads/growing-up-in-the-way-of-jesus/room-to-grow/index.html")
("grow.room", "series", "grow.series")
("grow.room", "number", "01")
("grow.room", "nextEntry", "grow.entry.2")
("grow.room", "image", "grow.room.art")
("grow.room", "opening", "Someone asks what you want to do when you leave school. You give an answer. A week later, you are interested in something else.")
("grow.room", "opening", "Or you hear people talking about faith as though everyone else has it worked out. You have a question, but you are still trying to find the words for it.")
("grow.room", "opening", "There can be a lot of pressure to know who you are going to become. Choose your subjects. Find your people. Make good decisions. Have a plan. Even advice meant kindly can make the future feel like an assignment you should have started earlier.")
("grow.room", "opening", "If you want to follow Jesus, you might feel another pressure: surely you should already be more patient, more confident, better at praying, less easily annoyed.")
("grow.room", "opening", "Here is something worth pausing over. Jesus grew.")
("grow.room", "section", "grow.room.jesus")
